        "edition": "arXiv:2609.06905v1; Lean4.33.0/fixedMathlib",
        "anchor": "arXiv2609.06905v1 D1 positive-root uniqueness background; scalar antecedent to printed B10 canonical joint root",
        "wording_status": "faithful paraphrase",
        "attribution": "Attributed ASTIS completion of positive REAL scalar-root uniqueness background for Fan Chen, Sinho Chewi, Jianfeng Lu and Matthew S. Zhang. This is not the printed joint ΓP transport/B.11 identity or a main theorem."
      },
      "statement": "Let Ω be any measurable space, μ any measure, and A,B bounded positive real-linear operators on L²(μ;ℝ). Assume A²=B², where multiplication is composition. Then A=B. Positivity is symmetry plus nonnegative quadratic form on the complete real L² space. No finite/probability measure, finite-dimensional L², nontriviality, energy identity or real/complex CFC/extension certificate is assumed.",
      "assumptions": [
        "Let Ω be any measurable space, μ any measure, and A,B bounded positive real-linear operators on L²(μ;ℝ). Assume A²=B², where multiplication is composition. Then A=B. Positivity is symmetry plus nonnegative quadratic form on the complete real L² space. No finite/probability measure, finite-dimensional L², nontriviality, energy identity or real/complex CFC/extension certificate is assumed.",
        "Arbitrary measure, including zero/subsingleton/infinite-dimensional L²; no energy, CFC, complex extension or norm-preserving embedding certificate supplied."
      ],
      "formulae": [
        {
          "label": "Positive real L² operators: equality from equal squares",
          "tex": "A\\ge0,\\quad B\\ge0,\\quad A^2=B^2\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad A=B."
        }
      ],
